,"outputs":[{"localized_name":"images","name":"images","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"title":"Save Match Debug","properties":{"cnr_id":"comfy-core","ver":"0.5.1","Node name for S&R":"SaveImage","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{"filename_prefix":true},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["Qwen_LineArt_Debug"]},{"id":6,"type":"MarkdownNote","pos":[-1100,-200],"size":[380,700],"flags":{},"order":2,"mode":0,"inputs":[],"outputs":[],"title":"How to use","properties":{"ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":["# Line-Art Alignment Workflow\n\nQwen-Image-Edit internally resizes the image to a 1024x1024-area grid, so its line-art output drifts (scale + shift) by a few pixels relative to the colour original. This workflow auto-corrects that drift.\n\n## Inputs\n\n**Reference (top LoadImage):** the colour original you want to keep.\n\n**Moving (bottom LoadImage):** the Qwen-generated line-art (the one with drift).\n\n## Settings on the Align node\n\n- `transform_mode`: **similarity** (handles scale+shift+rotation)\n- `edge_preprocess`: **canny** (essential when matching colour ref to line-art)\n- `ransac_threshold`: 3.0 px (lower = stricter)\n\n## Output\n\n**Aligned** = the line-art warped onto the reference coordinate system.\nLoad this into Photoshop on top of the colour original — it should now overlay pixel-perfectly.\n\n**Debug** = the feature matches (green lines), useful to verify alignment quality.\n\n## Check the console\n\nAfter running, the ComfyUI terminal prints the detected transform:\n`tx=.. ty=.. scale=.. rot=.. matches=..`\nIf `matches` is very low (<20), switch edge_preprocess or raise max_features."],"color":"#222","bgcolor":"#000"},{"id":7,"type":"Image Comparer (rgthree)","pos":[800,-200],"size":[520,520],"flags":{},"order":6,"mode":0,"inputs":[{"dir":3,"name":"image_a","type":"IMAGE","link":6},{"dir":3,"name":"image_b","type":"IMAGE","link":7}],"outputs":[{"dir":4,"name":"IMAGE","type":"IMAGE","links":null}],"title":"Compare: Reference vs Aligned","properties":{"cnr_id":"rgthree-comfy","ver":"27b4f4cdcf3b127c29d5d8135ac1536ecbd4c383","comparer_mode":"Slide","Node name for S&R":"Image Comparer (rgthree)","ue_properties":{"widget_ue_connectable":{},"version":"7.8","input_ue_unconnectable":{}}},"widgets_values":[[]]}],"links":[[1,1,0,3,0,"IMAGE"],[2,2,0,3,1,"IMAGE"],[3,3,0,4,0,"IMAGE"],[5,3,1,5,0,"IMAGE"],[6,1,0,7,0,"IMAGE"],[7,3,0,7,1,"IMAGE"]],"groups":[],"config":{},"extra":{"frontendVersion":"1.36.12","workflowRendererVersion":"LG","ue_links":[],"links_added_by_ue":[],"ds":{"scale":0.8,"offset":[90,427.5]},"workspace_info":{"id":"f415fa1e-3a0a-4263-b0bb-1e8a81117a16","saveLock":false,"cloudID":null,"coverMediaPath":null}},"version":0.4}